policy.description:
The policy must be a JSON string that contains the following information:

```json
  {
    "language_version": 1,
    "reference_columns": [
      "SNN"
    ],
    "statements": [
      {
        "roles": [
          "ADMINISTRATOR"
        ],
        "column_values": [
          "123-45-6789"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
```

* language_version: int, currently only allowed to be 1
* reference_columns: array(string), min=1, max=1
* roles: array, string, min=1, unique, string=>0,257
* column_values: array, string, min=1, unique, string=>0

Note: Policy text (when stringified) cannot exceed 10k
